#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/service.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Status and memory metrics"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:12
msgid ""
"`anima service status` and `/api/status` report process memory under "
"`memory_kb` and `memory_detail`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field / label                 | Source                                                 | Meaning                                                             |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `rss (phys)` / `memory_kb`    | Linux `VmRSS`, or `process.memoryUsage().rss` fallback | Physical RAM currently resident for the process                     |\n"
"| `heap (jsc)` / `heap_used_kb` | `process.memoryUsage().heapUsed`                       | JavaScriptCore heap accounting (not OS physical memory)             |\n"
"| `native` / `external_kb`      | `process.memoryUsage().external`                       | Native objects bound to JS                                          |\n"
"| `virtual` / `vm_size_kb`      | Linux `VmSize`                                         | Virtual address space reserved (Gigacage moats); not actual RAM use |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:21
msgid ""
"On Bun + JavaScriptCore, `heap (jsc)` can be **much larger than** `rss "
"(phys)`. Use RSS for “how much RAM does anima use?” Use heap trends (over "
"time, after GC) for JS pressure — not absolute comparison against RSS."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:23
msgid "Verify from the shell:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/service.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -s http://127.0.0.1:2658/api/status | jq '.memory_kb, .memory_detail'\n"
"grep -E '^(VmRSS|VmSize):' /proc/$(pgrep -f 'anima service' | head -1)/status\n"
"bun run memory:sample -- --url http://127.0.0.1:2658/api/status --stage full\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/service.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common commands"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/service.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima service start          # background (systemd user unit when available)\n"
"anima service start --foreground\n"
"anima service status\n"
"anima service stop\n"
"anima service restart\n"
"anima web start --foreground # 独立 Web 静态服（默认 :2659；生产推荐 web.enabled + service stack）\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:42
msgid ""
"`anima.service` 为 **单 unit stack**：Hub（`:2658`）+ 可选 Web（`:2659`）+ 可"
"选 Tunnel（cloudflared）由同一 foreground supervisor 管理。旧版 `anima-"
"tunnel.service` 在下次 `service start` 时自动停用。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:44
msgid ""
"配置 `web.enabled: true` 时 stack 会托管浏览器 Web UI（静态文件，不代理 Hub "
"API）。Hub 与 Web **分端口**；浏览器在设置页填写 Hub 地址与 `remote_auth` "
"token。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Startup order:** Hub must pass `GET /api/health` (`status: ok`) before Web/Tunnel sidecars start (`serve()` `onReady` → stack supervisor). SAP disconnects are retried by `@freeanima/sap-contract` transport (exponential backoff).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:47
msgid ""
"Admin UI 在 bundled shell 的 `/admin`（非 Hub `:2658`）。本地开发：`bun run "
"dev:web` → `http://127.0.0.1:4173/admin/dashboard`；Hub 仅提供 REST `/api/*` "
"与 SAP `/sap/v1`。"
msgstr ""
